 5. Configure PortFast and BPDrfaces of SW3/SW4.
 	There are 2 ways to configure at the interface level or global mode
	=====> SW3 will be configured per interface (interface or interface range cmd)
	=====> SW4 will configured on global mode


=====> SW3 will be configured per interface (interface or interface range cmd)
	SW3(config)#int f0/3
	SW3(config-if)#switchport mode access
	SW3(config-if)#spanning-tree portfast 
	SW3(config-if)#spanning-tree bpduguard enable

=====> SW4 will configured on global mode
	SW4(config)#spanning-tree portfast default
	SW4(config)#spanning-tree portfast bpduguard default 
	